    "deck": "As a daily essential for consumers, sun care users are seeking more than just UV protection. According to Mintel, 45% of Gen Z users are concerned about the environmental impact of sunscreen. In addition, Mintel reported a 23% increase in sunscreen products boasting sustainable claims when comparing 2020 to 2024 launches. Brands are stepping up with mineral-based, ethical, and sustainable solutions that also offer added skin benefits. In addition to a variety of skin care claims, mineral sunscreen formulations are highlighting innovative textures, high SPF water-resistance, and desirable aesthetics.",
